<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="cgaOi" id="cgaOi" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u2de279b7" id="u2de279b7">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u4ad993ba" id="u4ad993ba"> 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐞𝐥𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐒𝐚𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u7c5e5778" id="u7c5e5778"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5994c0f8" id="u5994c0f8">将 Transformer 模型的参数规模扩展至 500B 以上，已在自然语言处理、计算机视觉和强化学习等诸多任务上带来显著的性能提升</span></strong></p><ul list="u75ea87ac"><li fid="u617035c4" data-lake-id="u7ae6410d" id="u7ae6410d"><span data-lake-id="u44f55121" id="u44f55121">然而，在这一规模下，Transformer 解码仍然是一个开销高昂且效率低下的过程。Transformer 的采样过程通常受限于内存带宽</span></li><li fid="u617035c4" data-lake-id="uf7e33d8a" id="uf7e33d8a"><span data-lake-id="ud89ff791" id="ud89ff791">因此，在给定硬件配置下，从一阶近似来看，Transformer 模型生成单个词元所需的时间，与模型参数及 Transformer 记忆状态的存储规模成正比。语言模型的规模也使得服务部署必须采用模型并行，从而引入通信开销，并使资源需求成倍增加。由于每个新词元都依赖于此前的内容，因此，采样生成一个新序列需要多次调用 Transformer</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u73aeda21" id="u73aeda21"><strong><span data-lake-id="uffa2ec2e" id="uffa2ec2e">本文提出一种面向延迟敏感应用的 Transformer 采样加速算法，称为投机采样。该算法通过以下步骤实现</span></strong></p><ul list="u428940b2"><li fid="u4c462039" data-lake-id="ud60b1502" id="ud60b1502"><span data-lake-id="u4cc41c50" id="u4cc41c50">生成长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yw7kT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u132fe1cd" id="u132fe1cd">的短草稿序列。这既可以通过并行模型完成，也可以通过调用速度更快的自回归模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IkhZw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf073fe18" id="uf073fe18">次来实现。将该模型称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c43eab6" id="u3c43eab6">草稿模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4a69952a" id="u4a69952a">​</span></li><li fid="u4c462039" data-lake-id="uc8485354" id="uc8485354"><span data-lake-id="ud46eeedf" id="ud46eeedf">使用希望从中采样的、规模更大且能力更强的模型，对草稿序列进行评分。将该模型称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e96a52a" id="u6e96a52a">目标模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf9c3780b" id="uf9c3780b">​</span></li><li fid="u4c462039" data-lake-id="u5c6d7090" id="u5c6d7090"><span data-lake-id="ua4a8b379" id="ua4a8b379">采用一种改进的拒绝采样方案，从左到右接受</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zyuG5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucc444d45" id="ucc444d45">个草稿词元中的一部分，并在此过程中恢复目标模型的概率分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uffd2beea" id="uffd2beea"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8909ef45" id="u8909ef45" style="color: #DF2A3F">直观而言，在许多序列中，下一个词元可能是显而易见的。因此，如果草稿模型与目标模型在某个词元或词元子序列上的概率分布高度一致，上述机制便允许每次调用目标模型时生成多个词元</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="Bggw9" id="Bggw9" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub35cfc7d" id="ub35cfc7d">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u05d60ee1" id="u05d60ee1" style="color: #DF2A3F"> </span><span data-lake-id="u92499d00" id="u92499d00">𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐒𝐚𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u959afe55" id="u959afe55"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub629ed9c" id="ub629ed9c">对于投机采样，首先观察到：并行计算一段由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EcMPA%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub41b4d3e" id="ub41b4d3e">个词元构成的短续写序列的 logits，其延迟与采样生成单个词元的延迟十分接近。重点关注采用 Megatron 方式进行分片的大型 Transformer 模型。对于这些模型，采样时间主要由以下三个部分构成</span></strong></p><ul list="u8be8d526"><li fid="uf3f44d8f" data-lake-id="u3ef7391e" id="u3ef7391e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd025fad" id="ucd025fad">线性层：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue38c80f1" id="ue38c80f1">在批量大小较小时，每个线性层仅处理少量嵌入向量。这使得前馈层、查询、键、值的计算，以及最终注意力投影中的稠密矩阵乘法均受限于内存带宽。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v7reF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u127f87b0" id="u127f87b0">较小时，这些运算仍然受限于内存带宽，因此所需时间相近</span></li><li fid="uf3f44d8f" data-lake-id="u1d7c9a96" id="u1d7c9a96"><strong><span data-lake-id="uac2ece79" id="uac2ece79">注意力机制：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc5d780ac" id="uc5d780ac"> 注意力机制同样受限于内存带宽。在采样过程中，我们缓存序列中此前所有词元的键和值，以避免重复计算。这些 KV 缓存规模较大，占据了注意力机制内存带宽消耗的主要部分。然而，由于 KV 缓存的规模并不随 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g7R0u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96c63b3d" id="u96c63b3d"> 的增大而变化，因此这一部分的开销几乎没有差异，甚至完全相同。</span></li><li fid="uf3f44d8f" data-lake-id="u58832827" id="u58832827"><strong><span data-lake-id="u32376a95" id="u32376a95">全归约：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u85035461" id="u85035461"> 随着模型规模增大，其参数需要分布在多个加速器上，从而引入通信开销。在 Megatron 中，这体现为每个前馈层和注意力层之后的一次全归约操作。由于只需传输少量词元的激活值，因此，无论是采样还是评分，在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XN1JS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c111a6a" id="u0c111a6a">较小时，该操作通常都受限于延迟，而非吞吐量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc89be85d" id="uc89be85d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u64a43bca" id="u64a43bca">需要一种方法，能够利用草稿模型生成的样本，以及两个模型针对这些词元输出的 logits，恢复目标模型的概率分布。为此，针对草稿词元提出以下拒绝采样方案。给定词元序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8fcea58526a191897959c3da2ec701ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hm7Kq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u87035c2f" id="u87035c2f">，以及由</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa8fb240c01e0c91e16652265edad2d59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P61kL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u14d7708e" id="u14d7708e">生成的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dZCOH%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ad82e92" id="u8ad82e92">个草稿词元</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2BK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd867749644195b68ed1d0301fe23581d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22plSPS%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u970c775a" id="u970c775a">，以下述概率接受</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6ee32d914d666e37ca8de319e03c9e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qqIIa%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue2c3df75" id="ue2c3df75" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(1%2C%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n)%7D%7Bp(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n)%7D%5C%5Cright)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2054bfcd6c38e71736462e9ae9a5d15d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MquRR%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1f40a75f"><li fid="ubff806e7" data-lake-id="u6d8eccdd" id="u6d8eccdd"><span data-lake-id="u792a47cf" id="u792a47cf">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28602c5d91dec6d9e3bb6439af7f9511.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L7zK6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f3a5200" id="u4f3a5200">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F612b783676fba2a82d89894a16e3b409.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IUo20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua266df46" id="ua266df46">分别表示：在给定当前上下文的条件下，目标模型和草稿模型赋予词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6ee32d914d666e37ca8de319e03c9e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22q2Me9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5998b1b0" id="u5998b1b0">的概率</span></li><li fid="ubff806e7" data-lake-id="u8540ba8d" id="u8540ba8d"><span data-lake-id="u25855e88" id="u25855e88">如果该词元被接受，则令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94dbb3bcbdc29a173956bad7d2d8e3e1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x4rij%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u45242e7f" id="u45242e7f">，并对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa997b89f6f583bdab9510066fc8a98a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tYb7q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a474463" id="u8a474463">重复上述过程，直至某个词元被拒绝，或所有词元均被接受。如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bn%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6ee32d914d666e37ca8de319e03c9e12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22L2HKf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c006fbf" id="u8c006fbf">被拒绝，则从以下分布中重新采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bn%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F39d37abe873c552111e7efa07e33f317.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D0Bw7%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8eb74951" id="u8eb74951" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cleft(q(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n)-p(x%5C%5Cmid%20x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_n)%5C%5Cright)_%7B%2B%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff7f21bec7a85da75eb09cee776130a5e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l1FIm%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9ae31727" id="u9ae31727" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cleft(f(x)%5C%5Cright)_%7B%2B%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(0%2Cf(x)%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_x%5C%5Cmax%5C%5Cleft(0%2Cf(x)%5C%5Cright)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0b2fb7aebf69249ff1786460ef4b280c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sGfIQ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf36231a6" id="uf36231a6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2926bfa" id="ue2926bfa">通过依次应用上述过程，可以在硬件数值精度允许的范围内，为接受的词元恢复目标模型的分布</span></strong></p><ul list="u92e00198"><li fid="u7b8d1c19" data-lake-id="udbd7db79" id="udbd7db79"><span data-lake-id="u0cbeaa52" id="u0cbeaa52">每轮草稿生成—接受循环始终至少生成一个词元：即使第一个词元被拒绝，也会通过重新采样获得一个有效词元</span></li><li fid="u7b8d1c19" data-lake-id="u45ecbee9" id="u45ecbee9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u98634859" id="u98634859" style="color: #270070">由于草稿中的最后一个词元能够提供下一个词元的 logits，因此，如果所有草稿词元均被接受，就可以利用这些 logits 按常规方式再采样一个词元。这样，每轮循环最多可以生成</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%2B1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18930c90f0e05329c92ff1167f80c382.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g16k6%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u351d6baf" id="u351d6baf" style="color: #270070">个词元，而朴素实现最多只能返回</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22K%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38a3f4d664b7a723d138f9d57be0c783.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IESwW%22%7D" style="color: #270070"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucd65bb18" id="ucd65bb18" style="color: #270070">个词元</span></strong></li><li fid="u7b8d1c19" data-lake-id="ud65ce81d" id="ud65ce81d"><span data-lake-id="u8c6a395e" id="u8c6a395e">对于核采样、top-k 采样和温度调整等标准采样方法，可以先对概率进行相应变换，再应用上述拒绝采样方案</span></li></ul>